#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31398"
msgid "A unique feature of Embuary is the auto generation of hubs based on existing library tags in your database (e.g. 'kids content', 'HDR videos', 'documentaries')."
msgstr "Embuary 的一项独特功能是根据数据库中现有的资料库标签自动生成中心（例如“儿童内容”“HDR 视频”“纪录片”）。"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31399"
msgid "Since every setup is different and some people only want to have hubs for a few available tags, you can disable the ones you don't want to have populated at any time. By default future and new tags will be whitelisted automatically."
msgstr "由于每套配置都不同，且部分用户只想为少量标签创建中心，因此可随时禁用不需要自动填充的标签。默认情况下，今后新增的标签会自动加入白名单。"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31400"
msgid "Found tags"
msgstr "找到的标签"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31401"
msgid "Enabled tags"
msgstr "已启用标签"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31402"
msgid "To get the best out-of-box experience the skin will automatically populate shipped widgets for database items like 'in progress episodes', 'recently added movies' or suggestions based on the items you have watched."
msgstr "为了提供最佳的开箱体验，皮肤会自动为随附的小组件填充数据库项目，例如“正在观看的单集”“最近添加的电影”或根据您观看内容生成的推荐。"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31403"
msgid "Important"
msgstr "重要"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
msgctxt "#31404"
msgid "For existing Embuary installations, this step must be performed to get everything working due to a recent update. Configured custom widgets are not removed and only need to be reassigned."
msgstr "对于现有的 Embuary 安装，由于近期更新，必须执行此步骤。已配置的自定义小组件不会被删除，只需重新分配即可。"

#: /xml/Custom_1119_StartUp.xml
